    "created_at": "2019-06-05T08:18:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-05T08:18:12Z",
    "body": "Just to make it explicit, is the idea to keep this PR open until there's multi-vendor support, or also until the change is proven web compatible by shipping it? @annevk, on the multi-vendor support front, who at Mozilla can speak to this?\r\n\r\nAside: the `autofocus` attribute plus programmatic `element.focus()` following the same rules is great, and analogous to media autoplay.",
