    "body": "> That doesn't match the behavior of the `autofocus` attribute. Shouldn't the default allowlist be 'self'? If not, there is no web compat concern, so I suspect this is an oversight?\r\n\r\nI think this matches @clelland 's suggestion above and would place this policy along with the other [permission-like](https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-feature-policy/issues/298) policies.",
